    "text": "An allotment of land in total extent of 0.0526 Hectaredepicted as Lot No. 148 in the Sheet 03 Block No. 02 of Block07 in the Cadastral Map No. 620400 dated 09.05.2017 preparedby the Survey General, situated in the Vllage calledYakdehiwatta in the Grama Niladhari Division No. 174A ofYakdehiwatta of Nawadun Korale Meda Pattuwa MinorDivision in the Divisional Secretary's Division of Nivithigalain Rathnapura District of the Sabaragamuwa Province andmorefully described as follows.",
